# Vars: $RHOST target, $PORT the open port.  <user>/<pass>/<domain> = fill in.
# Provenance: every row extracted verbatim from source, only placeholder
#   normalization + output-file plumbing stripped. source = autorecon:<plugin>
#   or hacktricks:<page>:<line>. Nothing here is hand-written or model-generated.
#   AutoRecon: github.com/Tib3rius/AutoRecon (default-plugins)
#   HackTricks: github.com/HackTricks-wiki/hacktricks (network-services-pentesting)
